  "description": "Vivienne Mergoville has lived her entire life as a perfect aristocratic lady.  \n On the night the things she was proud of collapsed, she ran into her street and met her suspicious man.\n\n A mysterious man who says she is the Prime Minister's son.  Even though she didn't believe his words, she took Vivienne's hand.  \n She didn't care, she thought, as long as she could get her off her abusive fiancé and the family who treated me like family cattle.\n\n She doesn't know that the man leads the bottomless pit.\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://ridibooks.com/books/5067000001)\n\n**Official Translations:**    \n[Japanese](https://www.comico.jp/comic/13713)",
